{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi.md","title":"Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯","display":"Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi","aliases":["14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi"],"display":"Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小且有有限极限的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是 Grothendieck 拓扑，筛见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i:C_i\\to C\">\\(f_i:C_i\\to C\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le i\\le n\">\\(1\\le i\\le n\\)</span>）是有限箭头族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle\\)</span> 是下式定义的生成筛，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时为空筛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词；范畴等价采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle:=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{cod}(u)=C\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\operatorname{dom}(u),C_i)\\;(u=f_i\\circ g)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle:=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{cod}(u)=C\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\operatorname{dom}(u),C_i)\\;(u=f_i\\circ g)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\in S\\ (\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle\\in J(C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\in S\\ (\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle\\in J(C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>精确来源：原书 IX.11，印刷 p.519。有限覆盖族基等价于每个覆盖筛含一个生成覆盖筛的有限子族；这符合原书定义。旧<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f6f087e2448d2657\" href=\"?note=f6f087e2448d2657\" title=\"14-thm-deligne-enough-points\">14-thm-deligne-enough-points</a>要求对任意余极限经单一分量因子化，不是相干性，例如 Set×Set 被错误排除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\mathcal U$-小且有有限极限的范畴；$J$ 是 Grothendieck 拓扑，筛见 [[14-df-sieve]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-deligne-enough-points","status":"resolved","id":"f6f087e2448d2657","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"精确来源：原书 IX.11，印刷 p.519。有限覆盖族基等价于每个覆盖筛含一个生成覆盖筛的有限子族；这符合原书定义。旧[[14-thm-deligne-enough-points]]要求对任意余极限经单一分量因子化，不是相干性，例如 Set×Set 被错误排除。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f_i:C_i\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le i\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle:=\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{cod}(u)=C\\land\\exists i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\operatorname{dom}(u),C_i)\\;(u=f_i\\circ g)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall S\\in J(C)\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\in S\\ (\\langle f_1,\\ldots,f_n\\rangle\\in J(C)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).","display":true}],"bytes":2100,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi|Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi|Definition — 有限型站点与相干拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"e174b0a1a0ce73b6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论；相干性采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义。"},{"id":"f6f087e2448d2657","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}$ 采用 [[14-df-finite-type-sites-and-coherent-topoi]] 的有限型站点定义；足够多点见 [[14-df-enough-points]]。"}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","3fcbbf29a7947555","e21364f5dcced9e7","c502117a84587a7c","f6f087e2448d2657"]}